                <note rend="inline" type="source">891.6363 Amiranian/64: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Iran</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Engert</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Teheran</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1938-06-12T11:00:00+03:25">June 12, 1938—11
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received June 12—9:45 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>68. My 56, May 29, 11 a.m. Official written notification was only presented this
                    morning.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Engert</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
